GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Customer?$expand=profile

###
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Customer?$expand=orders

# Create Customer 
###
POST http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/catalog/Customer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Cust_ID": 100,
  "cust_name": "Jane Doe",
  "phone": 9876543210,
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "address_city": "Bangalore",
  "address_state": "Karnataka",
  "address_postal_code": 560001,
  "profile": {
    "ID": 1000,
    "loyaltyPoints": 0,
    "memberShip": "Bronze"
  }
}

###
